## User

The sum of a list of natural numbers.

## Type

type
```agda
sumList : List ℕ → ℕ
```

## Term

```agda
sumList [] = 0
sumList (x ∷ xs) = x + sumList xs
```

## agda

```agda
sumList-++ : ∀ xs ys → sumList (xs ++ ys) ≡ sumList xs + sumList ys
```

## agda

```agda
sumList-++ [] ys = refl
sumList-++ (x ∷ xs) ys =
  begin
    sumList (x ∷ xs) + sumList ys
  ≡⟨⟩
    x + sumList (xs ++ ys)
  ≡⟨ cong (x +_) (sumList-++ xs ys) ⟩
    x + sumList xs + sumList ys
  ≡⟨⟩
    x + sumList (x ∷ xs) + sumList ys
  ∎
```

